<h1>Interactivity in Web Apps</h1>

<p>When you visit a website or open an app, you're not just looking at information, you're doing something with it. Interactivity is what turns a static page into an engaging experience. It's what allows users to click, tap, type, scroll, or hover to make something happen.</p>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px;">
<p>📖 <b>Interactivity</b> is the ability of a software application or website to respond to user input.</p>
</div>

<br>
<p>Below, try spotting interactivity yourself. Hover or click around the mock site and see what you find.</p>

---

<div style="width:100%; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; margin:20px 0;">
